<script lang="ts">import {DropdownMenu} from 'bits-ui';type MenuItem={label:string;onclick?:()=>void;disabled?:boolean;checked?:boolean;onchange?:(checked:boolean)=>void};let {label='More actions',items}:{label?:string;items:MenuItem[]}=$props();</script><DropdownMenu.Root><DropdownMenu.Trigger class="ui-menu-trigger" data-variant="tertiary" aria-label={label}><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></DropdownMenu.Trigger><DropdownMenu.Portal><DropdownMenu.Content class="ui-menu-content" sideOffset={4} align="end">{#each items as item}{#if item.checked !== undefined}<DropdownMenu.CheckboxItem class="ui-menu-item" checked={item.checked} onCheckedChange={item.onchange}>{#snippet children({checked})}<span class="ui-menu-check" aria-hidden="true">{checked?'✓':''}</span>{item.label}{/snippet}</DropdownMenu.CheckboxItem>{:else}<DropdownMenu.Item class="ui-menu-item" disabled={item.disabled} onclick={item.onclick}>{item.label}</DropdownMenu.Item>{/if}{/each}</DropdownMenu.Content></DropdownMenu.Portal></DropdownMenu.Root><style>:global(.ui-menu-trigger){display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:var(--control-h);height:var(--control-h);padding:0;border:var(--line) solid transparent;border-radius:var(--radius-control);background:transparent;color:var(--text-body);cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation}:global(.ui-menu-content){z-index:var(--layer-menu);min-width:var(--menu-min-width);padding:var(--space-1);border:var(--line) solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-control);background:var(--surface-1);box-shadow:var(--elevation-menu)}:global(.ui-menu-item){display:flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--space-2);min-height:var(--control-h);padding:0 var(--space-3);border-radius:var(--radius-control);color:var(--text-body);outline:none}:global(.ui-menu-item[data-highlighted]){background:var(--surface-h